Privacy Policy for "Router Manager Pro"


At "Router Manager Pro", we take your privacy seriously when using our software. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect the data we collect through your use of our application.


1. Information We Collect


When using "Router Manager Pro", we collect only the following information:


IP Address: To connect to the router.


Username: To log in to the router’s settings page.


Password: To log in to the router’s settings page.


2. How We Use Your Data


We use the data we collect only for the following purposes:


Connecting to the Router: To modify router settings such as frequencies or read network information.


Improving User Experience: To ensure the application runs properly and provides a smooth user experience.


3. How We Protect Your Data


We take security measures to protect the information you provide:


Data Encryption: We ensure that sensitive information like your username and password is encrypted when sent to the router over the connection.


Secure Storage: We do not store your username or password permanently within the application. They are kept only temporarily during the connection process.


4. Sharing Your Data with Third Parties


We do not share any of your data (IP address, username, password) with third parties and only use it within the application.


5. Your Rights


Since we do not store your data permanently, your rights are limited to modifying or removing the data entered during use of the application.


6. Changes to the Privacy Policy


We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. If any significant changes are made, we will notify you within the application.


7. Contact Us


